@prefix c: <https://curricula.live/id/formal-sciences/concept/> .
@prefix v: <https://curricula.live/id/formal-sciences/vocab/> .
@prefix scheme: <https://curricula.live/id/formal-sciences/scheme/> .
@prefix skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#> .

c:two-sat-implication-graph-algorithm v:solves c:two-satisfiability .
c:tseitin-transformation v:uses c:conjunctive-normal-form .
c:tseitin-transformation v:guarantees c:equisatisfiability .
c:unit-propagation v:uses c:unit-clause .
c:unit-clause v:uses c:literal-propositional-logic .
c:automata-theoretic-ltl-model-checking v:uses c:linear-temporal-logic .
c:automata-theoretic-ltl-model-checking skos:broader c:model-checking .

c:modal-necessity v:uses c:kripke-frame .
c:modal-possibility v:uses c:kripke-frame .
c:kripke-model v:uses c:kripke-frame .
c:bisimulation-modal-logic v:uses c:kripke-model .
c:computation-tree-logic v:uses c:path-quantifier .
c:ctl-model-checking v:uses c:computation-tree-logic .
c:ctl-state-labeling-algorithm v:solves c:ctl-model-checking .
